  FT["MY-H3046"] = {"id":"MY-H3046","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 242/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年联邦道路（私营管理）（通行费征收）（士乃—巴西古当—迪沙鲁大道）（修正）（第3号）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (SENAI–PASIR GUDANG–DESARU EXPRESSWAY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) ORDER 2015","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (SENAI–PASIR GUDANG–DESARU EXPRESSWAY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Pengurusan Swasta) (Kutipan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Senai-Pasir Gudang-Desaru) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 3) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Quản lý tư nhân) (Thu phí đường bộ) (Đường cao tốc Senai-Pasir Gudang-Desaru) (Sửa đổi) (số 3) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (การบริหารจัดการเอกชน) (การจัดเก็บค่าผ่านทาง) (ทางด่วนเซอไน-ปาซีร์กูดัง-เดซารู) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Pengelolaan Swasta) (Pemungutan Tol) (Jalan Tol Senai-Pasir Gudang-Desaru) (Perubahan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA242","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2015_P.U.(A)242-2015_FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (SENAI-PASIR GUDANG-DESARU EXPRESSWAY).txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3046-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol) (Lebuh Raya SenaiPasir\n\nGudangDesaru) (Pindaan) (No. 3) 2015.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Oktober 2015.\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H3046-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan (Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol)\n\n(Lebuh Raya SenaiPasir GudangDesaru) 2011 [P. U. (A) 231/2011], yang disebut\n\n\"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam subperenggan 2(1)—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"17 Julai 2038\" dengan perkataan\n\n\"17 Julai 2048\";\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"ruang (3)\" di mana-mana jua terdapat,\n\ndengan perkataan \"ruang (2)\"; dan\n\n(c) dengan memotong perkataan \"mengikut tahun-tahun konsesi yang\n\ndinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama,\".\n\nPenggantian Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H3046-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Jadual Pertama Perintah ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual Pertama\n\ndengan Jadual yang berikut:\n\n\"JADUAL PERTAMA\n\n[subperenggan 2(1)]\n\nKADAR TOL BAGI LEBUH RAYA SENAI-PASIR GUDANG-DESARU\n\nBAGI TEMPOH KONSESI DARI 15 OKTOBER 2015 HINGGA 17 JULAI 2048\n\nPlaza Tol Keluar : Senai\n\n(1)\n\nPlaza Tol Masuk\n\n(2)\n\nTol Kena Dibayar (RM) Mengikut Kelas Kenderaan\n\nKelas 1 Kelas 2 Kelas 3 Kelas 4 Kelas 5"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3047"] = {"id":"MY-H3047","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 242/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年关税（临时保障措施税）（第2号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (PROVISIONAL SAFEGUARD DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2016","orig":"CUSTOMS (PROVISIONAL SAFEGUARD DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Duti Langkah Perlindungan Sementara) (Bilangan 2) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Thuế tự vệ tạm thời) (số 2) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (อากรมาตรการปกป้องชั่วคราว) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Bea Tindakan Pengamanan Sementara) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA242","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2016_P.U.(A)242-2016_CUSTOMS (PROVISIONAL SAFEGUARD DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3047-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Duti Pelindung\nSementara) (No. 2) 2016.\n\n(2) Perintah ini  berkuat  kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 27 September 2016\nhingga 14 April 2017.\n\nDuti pelindung sementara"}},{"id":"MY-H3047-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Duti pelindung sementara  hendaklah dilevi terhadap dan dibayar oleh\npengimport berkenaan dengan barang -barang  yang dinyatakan dalam ruang  (1)\ndan (2) Jadual yang dieksport dari negara yang dinyatakan dalam ruang ( 3) ke dalam\nMalaysia pada kadar yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (4).\n\nCagaran"}},{"id":"MY-H3047-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Duti pelindung sementara yang dilevi di bawah Perintah ini hendaklah dijamin\noleh suatu cagaran yang sama amaunnya dengan amaun duti yang dilevi.\n\nPenjenisan barang-barang"}},{"id":"MY-H3047-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Penjenisan barang -barang yang  dinyatakan dalam Jadual hendaklah\nmematuhi Rukun -Rukun Tafsiran dalam Perintah Duti Kastam 2012\n[P.U. (A) 275/2012].\n\n (2) Nombor kepala atau subkepala yang dinyatakan dalam ruang ( 1) Jadual\ndiperuntukkan bagi kemudahan  rujukan dan tidak mempunyai kesan mengikat\nterhadap penjenisan barang-barang yang diperihalkan dalam ruang (2).\n\nKesan terhadap duti import dan cukai barang dan perkhidmatan"}},{"id":"MY-H3047-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Pengenaan duti pelindung sementara di bawah Perintah ini tidaklah menjejaskan\npengenaan dan pemungutan—\n\n(a) duti import di bawah Akta Kastam 1967; dan\n\n(b) cukai barang dan perkhidmatan di bawah Akta Cukai Barang dan\nPerkhidmatan 2014 [Akta 762].\n\nJADUAL\n[Perenggan 2]\nDUTI PELINDUNG SEMENTARA\n\n(1) (2)\nPerihalan\nBarang-Barang\n\n(3) (4)\nNombor Kepala/\nSubkepala\nmengikut\nKod H.S.\n(Kod AHTN)\nNegara Kadar Duti\n[Peratusan\n(%) daripada\nNilai Kos,\nInsurans dan\nTambang\n(KIT)]\n\n7213.10 000,\n7213.91 000,\n7213.99 000\ndan\n7227.90 000\n\n(7213.10 00 00,\n7213.91 10 00,\n7213.91 20 00,\n7213.91 90 00,\n7213.99 10 00,\n7213.99 20 00,\n7213.99 90 00\ndan\n7227.90 00 00)\nRod dawai keluli dalam aloi\natau bukan aloi gulungan\npanas dan b ar bebunga\ndalam gegelung, dalam\ngegelung belitan sekata atau\ntidak sekata, tidak\ntermasuk—\n\n(a) rod dawai keluli dan\nbar bebunga dalam\ngegelung dengan\nkandungan karbon\n0.60 peratus atau\nlebih atau\nberdiameter lebih\nbesar daripada 16.0\nmilimeter; dan\n\n 1. Armenia\n2. Australia\n3. Kanada\n4. Croatia\n5. Republik Czech\n6. Kesatuan Eropah\n7. Republik\nPersekutuan\nJerman\n8. Perancis\n9. Greece\n10. Hungary\n11. Ireland\n12. Itali\n13.90%\n\n(b) keluaran yang\ndiimport bagi maksud\npenggunaan akhir\nindustri automotif,\nelektrik dan\nelektronik, minyak\ndan gas dan\npembinaan tahan\ngempa bumi daripada\nsemua gred dan\nspesifikasi\n\n13. Jepun\n14. Negara Belgium\n15. Negara Denmark\n16. Negara Norway\n17. Negara Sepanyol\n18. Negara Sweden\n19. Negara Belanda\n20. Liechtenstein\n21. Luxembourg\n22. New Zealand\n23. Republik  Rakyat\nChina\n24. Republik\nPortugal\n25. Republik Austria\n26. Republik\nBulgaria\n27. Republik Cyprus\n28. Republik Estonia\n29. Republik Finland\n30. Republik Iceland\n31. Republik Korea\n32. Republik Latvia\n33. Republik\nLithuania\n34. Republik Malta\n35. Republik Poland\n36. Republik\nSingapura\n37. Republik\nSlovenia\n38. Romania\n39. Republik Slovak\n40. Switzerland\n41. United Kingdom\nof Great Britain\ndan Ireland Utara\n\n42. Amerika Syarikat\nDibuat 23 September 2016\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-249 Klt.7 Sk.11; 0.9060/18(SJ.30); PN(PU2)647/VI]\n\nDATUK JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 11(2) Akta Kastam 1967]\n\nSAFEGUARDS ACT 2006 AND CUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS (PROVISIONAL SAFEGUARD DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 22 of the Safeguards Act 2006 [Act 657] and\nsubsection 11(1) of the Customs Act 1967 [ Act 235], the Minister makes the following\norder:\n\nCitation and commencement\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Customs (Provisional Safeguard Duties)\n(No. 2) Order 2016.\n\n(2) This Order has effect for the period  from 27 September 2016\nto 14 April 2017.\n\nProvisional safeguard duties\n2. Provisional safeguard  duties shall be levied on and paid by the importers in\nrespect of the goods specified in columns (1) and (2) of the Schedule exported from the\ncountries specified in column (3) into Malaysia at the rate specified in column (4).\n\nSecurity\n3. The provisional safeguard duties levied under this Order shall be guaranteed by\na security which amaunt is equal to the amount of the duties levied.\n\nClassification of goods\n4.  (1) The classification of goods specified in the Schedule shall comply with the\nRules of Interpretation in the Customs Duties Order 2012 [P.U. (A) 275/2012].\n\n(2) The heading or subheading number s specified in column ( 1) of the\nSchedule are provided for ease of  reference and ha ve no binding effect on the\nclassification of goods described in column (2).\n\nEffect on import duties and goods and services tax\n5. The imposition of provisional safeguard duties under this Order is without\nprejudice to the imposition and collection of—\n\n(a) import duties under the Customs Act 1967; and\n\n(b) goods and services tax under the\nGoods and Services Tax Act 2014 [Act 762].\n\nSCHEDULE\n[Paragraph 2]\nPROVISIONAL SAFEGUARD DUTIES\n\n(1) (2)\nDescription of Goods\n\n(3) (4)\nHeading/\nSubheading\nNumbers\naccording to\nH.S. Code\n(AHTN Code)\n\nCountries Rate of Duties\n[Percentage (%)\nof the Cost,\nInsurance and\nFreight (CIF)\nValue]\n\n7213.10 000,\n7213.91 000,\n7213.99 000\nand\n7227.90 000\n\n(7213.10 00 00,\n7213.91 10 00,\n7213.91 20 00,\n7213.91 90 00,\n7213.99 10 00,\n7213.99 20 00,\n7213.99 90 00\nand\n7227.90 00 00)\nSteel wire rods in hot\nrolled alloy or non -alloy\nand deformed bar in co ils,\nin regular or irregular\nwound coils, excluding—\n\n(a) steel wire rods and\ndeformed bar in coil\nwith carbon content\nof 0.60 percent or\nmore or diameter\ngreater than 16.0\nmillimetres; and\n\n(b) products imported\nfor the end -usage\npurposes of\nautomotive, electrical\nand electronic, oil\nand gas and\nearthquake proof\nconstruction\n1. Armenia\n2. Australia\n3. Canada\n4. Croatia\n5. Czech Republic\n6. European Union\n7. Federal Republic\nof Germany\n8. France\n9. Greece\n10. Hungary\n11. Ireland\n12. Italy\n13. Japan\n14. Kingdom of\nBelgium\n13.90%\n\nindustries o f all\ngrades and\nspecifications\n\n15. Kingdom of\nDenmark\n16. Kingdom of\nNorway\n17. Kingdom of\nSpain\n18. Kingdom of\nSweden\n19. Kingdom of the\nNetherlands\n20. Liechtenstein\n21. Luxembourg\n22. New Zealand\n23. People's\nRepublic of\nChina\n24. Portuguese\nRepublic\n25. Republic of\nAustria\n26. Republic of\nBulgaria\n27. Republic of\nCyprus\n28. Republic of\nEstonia\n29. Republic of\nFinland\n30. Republic of\nIceland\n31. Republic of\nKorea\n32. Republic of\nLatvia\n33. Republic of\nLithuania\n34. Republic of\nMalta\n35. Republic of\nPoland\n\n36. Republic of\nSingapore\n37. Republic of\nSlovenia\n38. Romania\n39. Slovak Republic\n40. Switzerland\n41. United Kingdom\nof Great Britain\nand Northern\nIreland\n42. United States of\nAmerica\n\nMade 23 September 2016\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-249 Klt.7 Sk.11; 0.9060/18(SJ.30); PN(PU2)647/VI]\n\nDATUK JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nSecond Minister of Finance\n\n [To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 11(2) of the Customs Act 1967]"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3048"] = {"id":"MY-H3048","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 242/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年费用（护照与签证）（费用免除）令","en":"FEES (PASSPORTS AND VISAS) (REMISSION OF FEES) ORDER 2017","orig":"FEES (PASSPORTS AND VISAS) (REMISSION OF FEES) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Fi (Pasport dan Visa) (Remisi Fi) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Phí (Hộ chiếu và thị thực) (Miễn giảm phí) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งค่าธรรมเนียม (หนังสือเดินทางและวีซ่า) (การงดเว้นค่าธรรมเนียม) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Biaya (Paspor dan Visa) (Pembebasan Biaya) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA242","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2017_P.U.(A)242-2017_FEES (PASSPORTS AND VISAS) (REMISSION OF FEES) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3048-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Fi (Pasport dan Visa)\n\n(Peremitan Fi) 2017.\n\n(2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh dari 22 Ogos 2017\n\nhingga 31 Julai 2018.\n\nPeremitan fi"}},{"id":"MY-H3048-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Fi bagi visa kemasukan berulang kali yang kena dibayar di bawah\n\nbutiran 2.II(e) Perintah Fi (Pasport dan Visa) 1967 [P.U. 189/1967] bagi warganegara\n\nIndia diremitkan satu ratus peratus.\n\n(2) Peremitan fi di bawah subperenggan (1) hanya terpakai bagi warganegara\n\nIndia yang datang ke Malaysia bagi maksud lawatan sosial, tertakluk kepada syarat yang\n\nberikut:\n\n(a) permohonan bagi visa kemasukan berulang kali dibuat melalui\n\nSistem Elektronik Visa;\n\n(b) visa kemasukan berulang kali sah bagi tempoh tiga bulan dari tarikh\n\nkelulusan visa;\n\n(c) tempoh tinggal di Malaysia terhad kepada lima belas hari sahaja bagi\n\nsetiap kemasukan dan tidak boleh dilanjutkan; dan\n\n(d) masuk dan keluar dari Malaysia hanya melalui pos kawalan imigresen,\n\ntempat mendarat yang dibenarkan, lapangan terbang yang dibenarkan\n\natau pintu masuk yang dibenarkan sebagaimana yang diwartakan\n\ndi bawah subseksyen 5(1) Akta Imigresen 1959/63 [Akta 155].\n\nDibuat 24 Julai 2017\n\n[KDN(S): IM 03/208/4 JLD. 3; PN(PU2)86/XXV]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah\n\nTAN SRI DR. ALI BIN HAMSA\n\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\nFEES ACT 1951\n\nFEES (PASSPORTS AND VISAS) (REMISSION OF FEES) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 10 of the Fees Act 1951 [Act 209],\n\nthe Yang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
