  FT["MY-H3332"] = {"id":"MY-H3332","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年水务产业（许可）（豁免）令","en":"WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (LICENSING) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012","orig":"WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (LICENSING) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Industri Perkhidmatan Air (Pelesenan) (Pengecualian) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Ngành dịch vụ nước (Cấp phép) (Miễn trừ) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งอุตสาหกรรมบริการน้ำ (การออกใบอนุญาต) (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Industri Jasa Air (Perizinan) (Pembebasan) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2012_P.U.(A)259-2012_WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (LICENSING) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3332-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Industri Perkhidmatan Air\n\n(Pelesenan) (Pengecualian) 2012.\n\n (2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah berkuat kuasa pada 19 Mac 2012 dan terus\n\nberkuat kuasa hingga 31 Mei 2012.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H3332-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Salcon Engineering Berhad dikecualikan daripada kehendak pelesenan di bawah\n\nseksyen 4 Akta bagi menyediakan perkhidmatan bekalan air di Loji Rawatan Air Sungai\n\nLabu, Selangor.\n\nTakat pengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H3332-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Walau apa pun pengecualian yang diberikan di bawah perenggan 2, Salcon\n\nEngineering Berhad hendaklah mematuhi kewajipan dan obligasi pemegang lesen\n\nindividu seolah-olah ia pemegang lesen individu di bawah Akta ini.\n\nDibuat 30 Julai 2012\n\n[KeTTHA :BP(S) 9/9 Klt.22; PN(PU2)660/VIII]\n\nDATO' SRI PETER CHIN FAH KUI\n\nMenteri Tenaga, Teknologi Hijau dan Air\n\nWATER SERVICES INDUSTRY ACT 2006\n\nWATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (LICENSING) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 5 of the Water Services Industry Act\n\n2006 [Act 655], the Minister, upon the recommendation of the Commission, makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3333"] = {"id":"MY-H3333","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2013&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年供应管制（管制物品）（第4号）（修正）令","en":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2013","orig":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Bekalan (Barang Kawalan) (Bilangan 4) (Pindaan) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát nguồn cung (Hàng hóa được kiểm soát) (số 4) (Sửa đổi) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมเสบียง (สิ่งของควบคุม) (ฉบับที่ 4) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Persediaan (Barang yang Dikendalikan) (Nomor 4) (Perubahan) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en；已清除正文中的 1 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2013_P.U.(A)259-2013_CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3333-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Bekalan (BarangBarang Kawalan) (No. 4) (Pindaan) 2013.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 5 Ogos 2013.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H3333-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Kawalan Bekalan (Barang-Barang Kawalan) (No. 4) 1974\n\n[P.U. (A) 386/1974] dipinda dalam Jadual dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Bahanapi\n\ndisel\" dengan perkataan \"Semua gred bahan api diesel, dan campuran bahan api diesel\n\ndan biobahan api\".\n\nDibuat 24 Julai 2013\n\n[KPDN (PGK) (S) 0.5001/5 Jld. 8; PN(PU2)188/VII]\n\nDATO' HASAN BIN MALEK\n\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri,\n\nKoperasi dan Kepenggunaan\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES ACT 1961\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) ORDER\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 5 of the Control of Supplies Act 1961\n\n[Act 122], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3334"] = {"id":"MY-H3334","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2015&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第23号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 23) ORDER 2015","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 23) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 23) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 23) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 23) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 23) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2015_P.U.(A)259-2015_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 23) ORDER 2015.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3334-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 23) 2015.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H3334-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam dan\n\nyang mungkin memudaratkan kepentingan awam adalah dilarang secara mutlak\n\ndi seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenyunting\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\n1. Warisan Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nKelantan:\n\nMengenal Diri\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\n168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nSentul, 51000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nLitmus Print\n\nShah Alam,\n\nSelangor\n\nMelayu\n\n2. Warisan Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nKelantan:\n\nMati Sebelum Mati\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook/Hj. Shaari\n\nbin Hj. Mohd\n\nYusof\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\n168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nSentul, 51000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nLitmus Print\n\nShah Alam,\n\nSelangor\n\nMelayu\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenyunting\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\n3. Warisan Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nKelantan:\n\nCahaya Di Atas\n\nCahaya\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook/Hj. Shaari\n\nbin Hj. Mohd\n\nYusof\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\n168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nSentul, 51000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nLitmus Print\n\nShah Alam,\n\nSelangor\n\nMelayu\n\n4. Warisan Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nKelantan:\n\n7 Petala Langit Dan\n\n7 Petala Bumi\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook/Hj. Shaari\n\nbin Hj. Mohd\n\nYusof\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\n168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nSentul, 51000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nLitmus Print\n\nShah Alam,\n\nSelangor\n\nMelayu\n\n5. Warisan Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nKelantan:\n\nMengenal Allah\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\n168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nSentul,\n\n51000 Kuala\n\nLumpur\n\nLitmus Print\n\nShah Alam,\n\nSelangor\n\nMelayu\n\n6. Pusaka Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nMengenal Allah\n\n(Tok Kenali\n\nKelantan)\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\nNo. 168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nJln. Sentul,\n\n51000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nBS Print (M)\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\nNo. 10, Jalan\n\nIndahrana 1\n\nOff Jalan\n\nKuchai Lama,\n\n58200 Kuala\n\nLumpur\n\nMelayu\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenyunting\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\n7. Pusaka Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nMengenal Diri\n\n(Tok Kenali\n\nKelantan)\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\nNo. 168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nJln. Sentul,\n\n51000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nBS Print (M)\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\nNo. 10, Jalan\n\nIndahrana 1\n\nOff Jalan\n\nKuchai Lama,\n\n58200 Kuala\n\nLumpur\n\nMelayu\n\nDibuat20 Oktober 2015\n\n[KDN:PQ(S)600-1/1Jld.6(12); PN(PU2)417/XV]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 23) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of\n\nthe Printing Presses and Publications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes\n\nthe following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 23) Order 2015.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order and likely to be prejudicial to public\n\ninterest are absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nEditor Publisher Printer Language\n\n1. Warisan Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nKelantan :\n\nMengenal Diri\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\n168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nSentul, 51000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nLitmus Print\n\nShah Alam,\n\nSelangor\n\nMalay\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nEditor Publisher Printer Language\n\n2. Warisan Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nKelantan: Mati\n\nSebelum Mati\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook/Hj.\n\nShaari bin Hj.\n\nMohd Yusof\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\n168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nSentul, 51000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nLitmus Print\n\nShah Alam,\n\nSelangor\n\nMalay\n\n3. Warisan Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nKelantan:\n\nCahaya Di Atas\n\nCahaya\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook/Hj.\n\nShaari bin Hj.\n\nMohd Yusof\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\n168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nSentul, 51000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nLitmus Print\n\nShah Alam,\n\nSelangor\n\nMalay\n\n4. Warisan Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nKelantan:\n\n7 Petala Langit\n\nDan 7 Petala\n\nBumi\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook/Hj.\n\nShaari bin Hj.\n\nMohd Yusof\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\n168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nSentul, 51000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nLitmus Print\n\nShah Alam,\n\nSelangor\n\nMalay\n\n5. Warisan Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nKelantan:\n\nMengenal Allah\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\n168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nSentul,\n\n51000 Kuala\n\nLumpur\n\nLitmus Print\n\nShah Alam,\n\nSelangor\n\nMalay\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nEditor Publisher Printer Language\n\n6. Pusaka Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nMengenal Allah\n\n(Tok Kenali\n\nKelantan)\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\nNo. 168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nJln. Sentul,\n\n51000 Kuala\n\nLumpur\n\nBS Print (M)\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\nNo. 10, Jalan\n\nIndahrana 1\n\nOff\n\nJalan Kuchai\n\nLama,\n\n58200 Kuala\n\nLumpur\n\nMalay\n\n7. Pusaka Ilmu\n\nTok Kenali\n\nMengenal Diri\n\n(Tok Kenali\n\nKelantan)\n\nMohd Yusof Cik\n\nWook\n\nTujuh Likur\n\nEnterprise\n\nNo. 168-01-12\n\nSentul Utara III,\n\nJln. Sentul,\n\n51000 Kuala\n\nLumpur\n\nBS Print (M)\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\nNo. 10, Jalan\n\nIndahrana 1\n\nOff Jalan\n\nKuchai Lama,\n\n58200 Kuala\n\nLumpur\n\nMalay\n\nMade 20 October 2015\n\n[KDN:PQ(S)600-1/1Jld.6(12); PN(PU2)417/XV]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3335"] = {"id":"MY-H3335","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年电力供应（单一买家授权）令","en":"ELECTRICITY SUPPLY (AUTHORIZATION TO BE A SINGLE BUYER) ORDER 2016","orig":"ELECTRICITY SUPPLY (AUTHORIZATION TO BE A SINGLE BUYER) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Bekalan Elektrik (Kebenaran sebagai Pembeli Tunggal) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Cung cấp điện (Ủy quyền làm người mua duy nhất) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งการจัดหาพลังงานไฟฟ้า (การอนุญาตให้เป็นผู้ซื้อรายเดียว) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Penyediaan Tenaga Listrik (Otorisasi sebagai Pembeli Tunggal) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2016_P.U.(A)259-2016_ELECTRICITY SUPPLY (AUTHORIZATION TO BE A SINGLE BUYER) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3335-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Bekalan Elektrik\n\n(Pemberian Kuasa untuk Menjadi Pembeli Tunggal) 2016.\n\nPemberian kuasa"}},{"id":"MY-H3335-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri memberikan kuasa kepada Pengurus Besar Kanan Jabatan Pembeli\n\nTunggal, Bahagian Perancangan dan Ekonomi Kawal Selia, Tenaga Nasional Berhad untuk\n\nmenjadi Pembeli Tunggal.\n\nDibuat 28 September 2016\n\n[KeTTHA.(S)100-1/1/5; PN(PU2)486/VII]\n\nDATUK SERI PANGLIMA DR. MAXIMUS JOHNITY ONGKILI\n\nMenteri Tenaga, Teknologi Hijau dan Air\n\nELECTRICITY SUPPLY ACT 1990\n\nELECTRICITY SUPPLY (AUTHORIZATION TO BE A SINGLE BUYER) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 22B(1) of the\n\nElectricity Supply Act 1990 [Act 447], the Minister, upon the recommendation of the\n\nCommission makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3336"] = {"id":"MY-H3336","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年价格管制与反暴利（汽油与柴油最高零售价格核定）（第24号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 24) ORDER 2017","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 24) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (Bilangan 24) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá bán lẻ tối đa đối với xăng và dầu diesel) (số 24) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาขายปลีกสูงสุดสำหรับน้ำมันเบนซินและดีเซล) (ฉบับที่ 24) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Eceran Maksimum untuk Bensin dan Solar) (Nomor 24) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2017_P.U.(A)259-2017_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3336-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel )\n(No. 24) 2017.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 14 September 2017.\n\nHarga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel"}},{"id":"MY-H3336-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel hendaklah sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H3336-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga  Runcit Maksimum\nbagi Petrol dan Diesel ) (No. 23) 2017 [P.U. (A) 255/2017] yang disiarkan dalam Warta\npada 6 September 2017 dibatalkan.\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL)\n(NO. 24) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the\nPrice Control and  Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723 ], the Controller, with the\napproval of the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n\nHARGA RUNCIT MAKSIMUM BAGI PETROL DAN DIESEL/\nMAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL\n\nKelas petrol dan diesel/\nClass of petrol and diesel\n\nHarga seliter/\nPrice per litre\n(RM)\n\nPetrol RON97/\nPetrol RON97\n\n2.52\n\nPetrol RON95/\nPetrol RON95\n\n2.21\n\nDiesel Euro2/\nDiesel Euro2\n\n2.14\n\nDiesel Euro5/\nDiesel Euro5\n\n2.24\n\nDibuat 13 September 2017\nMade 13 September 2017\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XVII]\n\nDATO' SRI JAMIL BIN SALLEH\nPengawal Harga/\nPrice Controller\n\nDiluluskan 13 September 2017\nApproved 13 September 2017\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XVII]\n\nDATO' SERI HAMZAH BIN ZAINUDIN\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri, Koperasi dan Kepenggunaan/\nMinister of Domestic Trade, Co-operatives and Consumerism"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3337"] = {"id":"MY-H3337","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年印花税（豁免）（第3号）令","en":"STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2018","orig":"STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Duti Setem (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 3) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tem (Miễn trừ) (số 3) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งอากรแสตมป์ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Bea Meterai (Pembebasan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2018_P.U.(A)259-2018_STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3337-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1)  Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Setem (Pengecualian)\n(No. 3) 2018.\n\n(2)  Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa mulai 1 Januari 20 18\nhingga 31 Disember 2020.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H3337-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1)  Bagi maksud perenggan ini, \"penyedia kredit\" ertinya—\n\n(a)  bank berlesen di bawah Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan 2013\n[Akta 758];\n\n(b)  bank Islam berlesen di bawah Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan\nIslam 2013 [Akta 759];\n\n(c)  institusi kewangan pembangunan yang ditetapkan di bawah Akta\nInstitusi Kewangan Pembangunan 2002 [Akta 618];\n\n(d)  penanggung insurans hayat berlesen di bawah Akta Perkhidmatan\nKewangan 2013;\n\n(e)  pengendali takaful berlesen di bawah Akt a Perkhidmatan\nKewangan Islam 2013;\n\n(f)  pengeluar instrumen pembayaran yang ditetapkan yang\ndiluluskan di bawah Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan 2013;\n\n(g)  koperasi yang didaftarkan di bawah Akta Koperasi 1993\n[Akta 502]; dan\n\n(h) Perbadanan Tabung  Pendidikan Tinggi Nasional yang ditubuhkan\ndi bawah Akta Perbadanan Tabung Pendidikan Tinggi\nNasional 1997 [Akta 566].\n\n(2) Tertakluk kepada subperenggan (4), semua surat cara yang berhubungan\ndengan penstrukturan atau penjadualan semula pinjaman  atau pembiayaan  yang\ndisempurnakan antara peserta program pengurusan kredit yang telah diluluskan oleh\nAgensi Kaunseling dan Pengurusan Kredit, suatu pertubuhan perbadanan yang\nditubuhkan di bawah seksyen 48 Akta Bank Negara Malaysia 2009 [ Akta 701 ],\ndengan penyedia kredit adalah dikecualikan daripada duti setem.\n\n(3)  Pengecualian dalam subperenggan (1) hendaklah terpakai bagi surat cara\ntersebut yang disempurnakan pada atau selepas 1 Januari 2018 tetapi tidak lewat\ndari 31 Disember 2020.\n\n(4) Permohonan untuk pengecualian di bawah perenggan ini  hendaklah\ndisertakan dengan surat tawaran daripada Agensi Kaunseling dan Pengurusan Kredit\nkepada peserta tersebut untuk penstrukturan atau penjadualan semula pinjaman ata u\npembiayaan di bawah program pengurusan kredit yang telah diluluskan oleh\nAgensi Kaunseling dan Pengurusan Kredit.\n\nDibuat 8 Oktober 2018\n[Perb. CR(8.09)248/39/7-217 Jld.13 (SK.4); LHDN.AY.A.600-12/1/1(15);\nPN(PU2)159/XXXII]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nSTAMP ACT 1949\n\nSTAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 80(1) of the\nStamp Act 1949 [Act 378], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3338"] = {"id":"MY-H3338","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2019&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年联邦道路（西海岸大道（太平—万津））（修正）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (WEST COAST EXPRESSWAY (TAIPING-BANTING)) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (WEST COAST EXPRESSWAY (TAIPING-BANTING)) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Lebuhraya Pantai Barat (Taiping-Banting)) (Pindaan) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Đường cao tốc Bờ Tây (Taiping-Banting)) (Sửa đổi) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (ทางด่วนชายฝั่งตะวันตก (ไทปิง-บันติง)) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Jalan Tol Pantai Barat (Taiping-Banting)) (Perubahan) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2019_P.U.(A)259-2019_FEDERAL ROADS (WEST COAST EXPRESSWAY (TAIPING-BANTING)) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3338-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Lebuh Raya Pesisiran Pantai Barat (Taiping-Banting)) (Pindaan) 2019.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 23 September 2019.\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H3338-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Lebuh Raya Pesisiran Pantai Barat\n\n(Taiping-Banting)) 2019 [P.U. (A) 150/2019], yang disebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah\n\nini, dipinda dalam perenggan 2—\n\n(a) Dengan menggantikan subperenggan (1) dengan subperenggan\n\nyang berikut:\n\n\"(1) Bahagian jalan yang berikut diisytiharkan sebagai\n\njalan Persekutuan:\n\n(a) bahagian jalan yang dikenali sebagai Lebuh Raya Pesisiran\n\nPantai Barat (Taiping–Banting) yang bermula dari\n\nkilometer 143.99 di koordinat U 421777.709,\n\nT 333667.462Grid Bentuk Benar Serong di Tepi (RSO)\n\nGeosentrik (GDM 2000) dan berakhir di kilometer 162.07\n\ndi koordinat U 438818.638, T 331585.659Grid RSO\n\nGeosentrik (GDM 2000) (kedua-dua jarak diukur dari\n\nkilometer 0.0 Lebuh Raya Pesisiran Pantai Barat\n\n(Taiping–Banting) di Persimpangan Bertingkat Banting)\n\ntermasuk Persimpangan Bertingkat Hutan Melintang,\n\nPlaza Tol Masuk/Keluar Hutan Melintang, Plaza Tol\n\nMasuk/Keluar Teluk Intan, Persimpangan Bertingkat\n\nTeluk Intan dan jalan-jalan sambungannya, iaitu suatu jarak\n\nsepanjang 18.08 kilometer; dan\n\n(b) bahagian jalan yang dikenali sebagai Lebuh Raya Pesisiran\n\nPantai Barat (Taiping-Banting) yang bermula dari\n\nkilometer 193.59 di koordinat U 455672.836, T 310764.161\n\nGrid Bentuk Benar Serong di Tepi (RSO) Geosentrik\n\n(GDM 2000) dan berakhir di kilometer 241.63 di koordinat\n\nU 498349.253, T 311975.628 Grid RSO Geosentrik\n\n(GDM 2000) (kedua-dua jarak diukur dari\n\nkilometer 0.0 Lebuh Raya Pesisiran Pantai Barat\n\n(Taiping-Banting) di Persimpangan Bertingkat Banting)\n\ntermasuk Persimpangan Bertingkat Kg. Lekir, Plaza Tol\n\nMasuk/Keluar Kg. Lekir, Persimpangan Bertingkat Sitiawan,\n\nPlaza Tol Masuk/Keluar Sitiawan, Persimpangan Bertingkat\n\nSitiawan Utara, Plaza Tol Masuk/Keluar Sitiawan Utara,\n\nPersimpangan Bertingkat Changkat Chermin, Plaza Tol\n\nMasuk/Keluar Changkat Chermin, Persimpangan Bertingkat\n\nBeruas, Plaza Tol Masuk/Keluar Beruas dan jalan-jalan\n\nsambungannya, iaitu suatu jarak sepanjang\n\n48.04 kilometer.\".\n\n(b) dalam teks bahasa Inggeris, dengan menggantikan subperenggan (2)\n\ndengan subperenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(2) The roads declared to be Federal roads under\n\nsubparagraph (1) are shown on the map in the Schedule.\".\n\nPenggantian Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H3338-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual dengan Jadual yang berikut:\n\nJADUAL\n\nPETUNJUK :\n\nCATATAN : TIDAK MENGIKUT SKALA\n\nKM 0.00\n\nPERSIMPANGAN\n\nBERTINGKAT\n\nBANTING\n\nPERSIMPANGAN\n\nPERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT BERUAS\n\nBERTINGKAT\n\nCHANGKAT CHERMIN\n\nPERSIMPANGAN\n\nBERTINGKAT\n\nSITIAWAN UTARA\n\nPERSIMPANGAN\n\nBERTINGKAT\n\nSITIAWAN\n\nPERSIMPANGAN\n\nBERTINGKAT KG.\n\nLEKIR\n\nPLAZA TOL KG.\n\nLEKIR\n\nKM 193.59\n\nU 455672.836\n\nT 310764.161\n\nKM 241.63\n\nU 498349.253\n\nT 311975.628\n\nKM 162.07\n\nU 438818.638\n\nT 331585.659\n\nPERSIMPANGAN\n\nBERTINGKAT\n\nTELUK INTAN\n\nPERSIMPANGAN\n\nBERTINGKAT HUTAN\n\nMELINTANG\n\nKM 143.99\n\nU 421777.709\n\nT 333667.462\n\nPLAZA TOL HUTAN\n\nMELINTANG\n\nPLAZA TOL\n\nTELUK INTAN\n\nJALAN YANG DIWARTAKAN SEBAGAI JALAN\n\nPERSEKUTUAN\n\nPERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT\n\nPLAZA TOL\n\nCADANGAN LEBUHRAYA\n\nJALAN JKR\n\nSEMPADAN NEGERI\n\nPLAZA TOL\n\nBERUAS\n\nPERSIMPANGAN\n\nBERTINGKAT\n\nCHANGKAT CHERMIN\n\nPLAZA TOL\n\nCHANGKAT CHERMIN\n\nPLAZA TOL\n\nSITIAWAN UTARA\n\nPLAZA TOL\n\nSITIAWAN\n\nDibuat 19 September 2019\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/20; PN(PU2)391/XXXVII]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\n Menteri Kerja Raya\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut seksyen 4 Akta Jalan Persekutuan 1959]\n\nFEDERAL ROADS ACT 1959\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (WEST COAST EXPRESSWAY (TAIPING-BANTING))\n\n(AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the Federal Roads Act 1959 [Act 376],\n\nthe Minister, after consultation with the State Government of Perak, makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Federal Roads (West Coast Expressway\n\n(Taiping-Banting)) (Amendment) Order 2019.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 23 September 2019.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2\n\n2. The Federal Roads (West Coast Expressway (Taiping-Banting)) Order 2019\n\n[P.U. (A) 150/2019], which is referred to as the \"principal Order\" in this Order, is amended\n\nin paragraph 2—\n\n(a) by substituting for subparagraph (1) the following subparagraph:\n\n\"(1) The following parts of the roads are declared to be Federal roads:\n\n (a) the part of the road known as the West Coast Expressway\n\n(Taiping–Banting) commencing from kilometre 143.99 at\n\ncoordinates N 421777.709, E 333667.462 of the Rectified\n\nSkew Orthomorphic (RSO) Geocentric (GDM 2000) Grid and\n\nending at kilometre 162.07 at coordinates N 438818.638,\n\nE 331585.659 of the RSO Geocentric (GDM 2000) Grid\n\n(both distances are measured from kilometre 0.0 of the\n\nWest Coast Expressway (Taiping–Banting) at the Banting\n\nInterchange) including the Hutan Melintang Interchange,\n\nHutan Melintang Entry/Exit Toll Plaza, Teluk Intan\n\nEntry/Exit Toll Plaza, Teluk Intan Interchange and its link\n\nroads, being a distance of 18.08 kilometre; and\n\n(b) the part of the road known as the West Coast Expressway\n\n(Taiping-Banting) commencing from kilometre 193.59 at\n\ncoordinates N 455672.836, E 310764.161 of the Rectified\n\nSkew Orthomorphic (RSO) Geocentric (GDM 2000) Grid and\n\nending at kilometre 241.63 at coordinates N 498349.253,\n\nE 311975.628 of the RSO Geocentric (GDM 2000) Grid\n\n(both distances are measured from kilometre 0.0 of the\n\nWest Coast Expressway (Taiping-Banting) at the Banting\n\nInterchange) including the Kg. Lekir Interchange, Kg. Lekir\n\nEntry/Exit Toll Plaza, Sitiawan Interchange, Sitiawan\n\nEntry/Exit Toll Plaza, Sitiawan North Interchange, Sitiawan\n\nNorth Entry/Exit Toll Plaza, Changkat Chermin Interchange,\n\nChangkat Chermin Entry/Exit Toll Plaza, Beruas\n\nInterchange, Beruas Entry/Exit Toll Plaza and its link roads,\n\nbeing a distance of 48.04 kilometre.\".\n\n (b) in the English text, by substituting for subparagraph (2) the following\n\nsubparagraph:\n\n\"(2) The roads declared to be Federal roads under subparagraph (1) are\n\nshown on the map in the Schedule.\".\n\nSubstitution of Schedule\n\n3. The principal Order is amended by substituting for the Schedule the\n\nfollowing Schedule:\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nLEGEND :\n\nNOTE: NOT TO SCALE\n\nROAD TO BE GAZETTED AS FEDERAL ROAD\n\nINTERCHANGE\n\nTOLL PLAZA\n\nPROPOSED EXPRESSWAY\n\nJKR ROAD\n\nSTATE BOUNDARY\n\nKM 0.00\n\nBANTING\n\nINTERCHANGE\n\nBERUAS\n\nINTERCHANGE\n\nCHANGKAT CHERMIN\n\nINTERCHANGE\n\nSITIAWAN UTARA\n\nINTERCHANGE\n\nSITIAWAN\n\nINTERCHANGE\n\nKG. LEKIR\n\nINTERCHANGE\n\nKG. LEKIR\n\nTOLL PLAZA\n\nKM 193.59\n\nN 455672.836\n\nE 310764.161\n\nKM 241.63\n\nN 498349.253\n\nE 311975.628\n\nKM 162.07\n\nN 438818.638\n\nE 331585.659\n\nTELUK INTAN\n\nINTERCHANGE\n\nHUTAN MELINTANG\n\nINTERCHANGE\n\nKM 143.99\n\nN 421777.709\n\nE 333667.462\n\nHUTAN MELINTANG\n\nTOLL PLAZA\n\nTELUK INTAN\n\nTOLL PLAZA\n\nBERUAS\n\nTOLL PLAZA\n\nCHANGKAT CHERMIN\n\nTOLL PLAZA\n\nSITIAWAN UTARA\n\nTOLL PLAZA\n\nSITIAWAN\n\nTOLL PLAZA\n\nMade 19 September 2019\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/20; PN(PU2)391/XXXVII]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMinister of Works\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3339"] = {"id":"MY-H3339","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年自雇人员社会保障（2019年额外供应）条例","en":"SELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (ADDITIONAL SUPPLY FOR THE YEAR 2019) REGULATIONS 2020","orig":"SELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (ADDITIONAL SUPPLY FOR THE YEAR 2019) REGULATIONS 2020","ms":"Peraturan Keselamatan Sosial Pekerja Sendiri (Bekalan Tambahan bagi Tahun 2019) 2020","vi":"Quy định về An sinh xã hội cho người tự làm việc (Cung ứng bổ sung cho năm 2019) năm 2020","th":"ข้อบังคับประกันสังคมผู้ประกอบอาชีพอิสระ (การจัดหาเพิ่มเติมสำหรับปี 2562) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Peraturan Jaminan Sosial Pekerja Mandiri (Penyerahan Tambahan Tahun 2019) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2020_P.U.(A)259-2020_SELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (ADDITIONAL SUPPLY FOR THE YEAR 2019) REGULATIONS 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3339-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nKeselamatan Sosial Pekerjaan Sendiri (Perbekalan Tambahan\n\nBagi Tahun 2019) 2020.\n\nPengeluaran bagi perbelanjaan tambahan bagi tahun 2019"}},{"id":"MY-H3339-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pengeluaran sejumlah wang yang tidak melebihi enam ratus sebelas ribu\n\nempat ratus ringgit (RM611,400) daripada Kumpulan Wang Keselamatan Sosial\n\nPekerjaan Sendiri bagi perbelanjaan tambahan untuk pentadbiran Skim Keselamatan\n\nSosial Pekerjaan Sendiri bagi tahun 2019 adalah dengan ini dibenarkan bagi maksud yang\n\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nJADUAL\n\nMaksud Amaun\n\n(RM)\n\nEmolumen 243,100\n\nBekalan dan perkhidmatan 9,700\n\nPerbelanjaan lain 358,600\n\nJumlah 611,400\n\nDibuat 1 September 2020\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)/600-1/2/27/6; PN(PU2)744/III]\n\nDATUK SERI SARAVANAN A/L MURUGAN\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nSELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY ACT 2017\n\n SELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (ADDITIONAL SUPPLY FOR THE YEAR 2019)\n\nREGULATIONS 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 47(1)\n\nof the Self-Employment Social Security Act 2017 [Act 789], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation\n\n1. These regulations may be cited as the Self-Employment Social Security\n\n(Additional Supply For The Year 2019) Regulations 2020.\n\nIssue for additional expenditure for the year 2019\n\n2. The issue of a sum not exceeding six hundred and eleven thousand\n\nfour hundred ringgit (RM611,400) from the Self-Employment Social Security Fund for the\n\nadditional expenditure on administration of the Self-Employment Social Security Scheme\n\nfor the year 2019 is hereby authorized for the purposes specified in the Schedule.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nPurposes Amount\n\n(RM)\n\nEmoluments 243,100\n\nSupplies and services 9,700\n\nOther expenditures 358,600\n\nTotal 611,400\n\nMade 1 September 2020\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)/600-1/2/27/6; PN(PU2)744/III]\n\nDATUK SERI SARAVANAN A/L MURUGAN\n\nMinister of Human Resources"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H334"] = {"id":"MY-H334","coverage":"partial","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=421&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":11,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1990年财政（第2号）法","en":"FINANCE (NO. 2) ACT 1990","orig":"FINANCE (NO. 2) ACT 1990","vi":"Luật về Tài chính (số 2) năm 1990","th":"พระราชบัญญัติการคลัง (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 1990","id":"Undang-Undang Keuangan (Nomor 2) Tahun 1990","ms":"Akta Kewangan (Bilangan 2) 1990"},"level":"law","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT421","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1990","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 17 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\1990_421_FINANCE (NO. 2) ACT 1990.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H334-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the Finance (No. 2) Act"}},{"id":"MY-H334-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. The Income Tax Act 1967, the Petroleum (Income\nTax) Act 1967, the Supplementary Income Tax Act\n1967, the Stamp Act 1949 and the Service Tax\nAct 1975 are amended in the manner specified in\nChapters II, III, IV, V and VI respectively.\n\nCHAPTER II\nAMENDMENTS TO THE INCOME TAX ACT 1967"}},{"id":"MY-H334-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"chapter":{"en":"CHAPTER II"},"text":{"en":"3. (1) Sections 4, 7 and 8 of this Chapter shall have\neffect for the year of assessment 1991 and subsequent\nyears of assessment.\n\n(2) Sections 5 and 6 shall have effect for the year of\nassessment 1990 and subsequent years of assessment.\n\nShort\ntitle.\n\nAmendments\n-of Acts.\n\nAct 53.\n\n45167.\n\nAct 54.\n\nAct 378.\n\nAct 151.\n\nCommence-\nment of\namendments\nto the\nIncome Tax\nAct 1967.\n\n(Cap. Il, S. 41\n\n6                                   Acr 421\n\nAmendment 4, Section 34a of the Income Tax Act 1967, which in\n\nof section\n34a.\nAct 53.\n\nthis Chapter is referred to as \"the principal Act\", is\namended by substituting for section 34a the following:\n\n\"Special 34a. (1) Subject to this section, in\n\ndeduction ascertaining the adjusted income of a person\n\nor research                      :                            A         .\n\nexpenditure. from a business for the basis period for a year\nof assessment, a deduction shall be made, as\nspecified in subsection (4), from the gross\nincome from the business for that period in\nrespect of expenditure, not being capital\nexpenditure incurred on plant, machinery,\nfixtures, land, premises, buildings, structures\nor works of a permanent nature or on\nalterations, additions or extensions thereof or\nin the acquisition of any rights in or over any\nproperty, incurred by that person during that\nperiod on research—\n\n(a) approved by the Minister; or\n\n(b) undertaken by that person where that\nperson is participating in industrial\nadjustment approved under section 31A\n\nAct 327.        of the Promotion of Investments Act\n\n(2) The Minister in approving the research\npursuant to subsection (1) (a) may impose\nsuch conditions as he thinks fit or may specify\nthe period or periods for the purpose of\ndeduction under this section.\n\n(3) A deduction for expenditure on\nresearch pursuant to subsection (1) (b) shall\nbe made in respect of expenditure incurred\nwithin ten years from the date of approval of\nindustrial adjustment under section 31A of the\nPromotion of Investments Act 1986.\n\n(4) The amount of deduction to be made\nunder subsection (1) shall be twice the amount\nof expenditure, not being capital expenditure,\nreferred to in that subsection.\n\n(Cap. Il, S.\nFINANCE (No. 2)             7\n\n(5) Where any deduction in respect of\nexpenditure on research is made under this\nsection, no deduction in respect of that\nexpenditure shall be made under section 33 or\n34.\"."}},{"id":"MY-H334-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"chapter":{"en":"CHAPTER II"},"text":{"en":"5. Section 39 of the principal Act is amended by\ndeleting paragraph (h) of subsection (1)."}},{"id":"MY-H334-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"chapter":{"en":"CHAPTER II"},"text":{"en":"6. Section 44 of the principal Act is amended—\n\n(a) by substituting for the full stop at the end' of\nparagraph (d) of subsection (7) in the\ndefinition of \"organisation\" a semicolon and\ninserting, immediately thereafter, the word\n\"or\"; and\n\n(b) by inserting, immediately after paragraph (d),\nthe following new paragraph (e):\n\n\"(e) an organisation engaged in or in\nconnection with the conservation or\nprotection of animals.\"'."}},{"id":"MY-H334-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"chapter":{"en":"CHAPTER II"},"text":{"en":"7. Schedule 3 to the principal Act is amended—\n\n(a) by deleting the word \"industrial\" in the\nheading to paragraph 378; and\n\n(b) by substituting for paragraph 37B the\nfollowing:\n\n\"37B. The provisions of this Schedule\nrelating to industrial building shall apply,\nmutatis mutandis, to a building or part\nthereof being in use for the purpose of—\n\n(a) research approved by the Minister\nwithin the meaning of section 34a (1)\n(a);\n\n(b) research undertaken by a company\nwhich is participating in industrial\nadjustment approved under section\n\nAct 327.              31A of the Promotion of Investments\nAct 1986;\n\n4-7]\n\nAmendment\nof section 39.\n\nAmendment\nof section 44.\n\nAmendment\nof Schedule\n\nw\n\n(Cap. II, S. 7-8]\n8                   Act 421\n\n(c) industrial training approved by the\nMinister; or\n\n(d) training undertaken by a company\nmentioned in subparagraph (b) in\nrespect of its employees,\n\nand in such application, the reference to\ncapital expenditure incurred on the\nconstruction of a building or part thereof,\nshall include any capital expenditure\nincurred on the alteration or renovation of\nrented premises for the purpose of carrying\non therein such research, industrial training\nor training and the building or part thereof\nshall be deemed to be in use for the purposes\nof the business referred to in section 34a,\nnotwithstanding that in the case of research\nreferred to in subparagraph (a), such\nresearch is not related to that business:\n\nProvided that the provisions of this\nSchedule relating to industrial building shall\nnot apply to capital expenditure incurred on\na building or part thereof for the purpose\nmentioned in subparagraph (b) or (d) where\nsuch expenditure is incurred after ten years\nfrom the date of approval of industrial\nadjustment under section 31a of the\nPromotion of Investments Act 1986.\"'.\n\nAmendment 8. Schedule 7a to the principal Act is amended—\nof Schedule\nTA.\n\n(a) by renumbering subparagraphs (a) and (b) of\nparagraph 8 as subparagraphs (a) (i) and (ii)\nrespectively;\n\n(b) by substituting for the full stop at the end of\nsub-subparagraph (ii) of subparagraph (a) of\nparagraph 8 a semicolon and inserting,\nimmediately thereafter, the word \"or\"; and\n\nFINANCE (No. 2)\n\n(Cap. I-IV, S. 8-12]\n\n(c) by inserting, immediately after subparagraph\n(a) of paragraph 8, the following new\n\nAct 327.\n\nsubparagraph (b):\n\n\"(b) a project undertaken by a company\n\nwhich is __ participating\n\nadjustment approved under section 31A of\n\nin\n\nindustrial\n\nthe Promotion of Investments Act 1986, in\nbusiness or\nmodernising its production techniques or\n\nexpanding its existing\n\nprocesses.\"'.\n\nCHAPTER III\n\nAMENDMENT TO THE PETROLEUM (INCOME TAX)\nA\n\nCT 1967"}},{"id":"MY-H334-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"chapter":{"en":"CHAPTER III"},"text":{"en":"9. This Chapter shall have effect for the year of\nassessment 1990 and subsequent years of assessment."}},{"id":"MY-H334-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"chapter":{"en":"CHAPTER III"},"text":{"en":"10. Section 18 of the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967\nis amended by deleting paragraph (1) of subsection (1).\n\nCHAPTER IV\n\nAMENDMENT TO THE SUPPLEMENTARY INCOME\n\nTAX ACT 1967"}},{"id":"MY-H334-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"chapter":{"en":"CHAPTER IV"},"text":{"en":"11. This Chapter shall have effect for the year of\nassessment 1990 and subsequent years of assessment."}},{"id":"MY-H334-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"chapter":{"en":"CHAPTER IV"},"text":{"en":"12. Section 16 of the Supplementary Income Tax Act\n1967 is amended by substituting for the words \"five per\ncent\" in paragraphs (a) and (b) the words \"four per\n\ncent\".\n\nCommence-\nment of\namendment\nto the\nPetroleum\n(Income\nTax) Act\n\nAmendment\nof section 18,\n45/67.\n\nCommence-\nment of\namendment\nto the\nSupplemen-\ntary Income\nTax Act\n\nAmendment\nof section 16.\nAct 54.\n\n(Cap. V-VI, S. 13-16]\n\n10                                 Act 421\n\nCHAPTER V\nAMENDMENTS TO THE STAMP ACT 1949\n\nCommences 13. This Chapter shall come into force on the 1st\n\nment of\nment ments JAnuary 1990.\n\nto the Stamp\nAct 1949.\n\nBanduan 14. The First Schedule to the Stamp Act 1949 is\nSchedule.   amended—\n\nAct 378.\n'             (a) by substituting for the full stop at the end of\n\nparagraph (e) of the exemptions under item 4\na semicolon and inserting, immediately\nthereafter, the following new paragraph (f):\n\n\"(f) for the repurchase of negotiable\ncertificate of deposit whose issue has\nbeen authorised by Bank Negara\nMalaysia.\"'; and\n\n(b) by substituting for the full stop at the end of\nsubparagraph (v) of paragraph (b) of the\nexemptions under item 32 a semicolon\nand inserting, immediately thereafter, the\nfollowing new paragraph (c):\n\n\"(c) Transfer of units of a unit trust.\"'.\n\nCHAPTER VI\nAMENDMENTS TO THE SERVICE TAX ACT 1975\n\nCommence. 15. This Chapter shall be deemed to have come into\nmentof == force on the 28th October 1989.\n\namendments\nto the\nService\n\nTax Act\n\nAmendment 16. Section 1 of the Service Tax Act 1975, which in this\nof section 1. Chapter is referred to as \"the principal Act\", is\n|    amended by inserting, immediately after the words\n\"excluding Langkawi\" in subsection (1), the words\n\n\"and Labuan\".\n\n(Cap. VI, S. 17)\n\nFINANCE (No. 2)                          11"}},{"id":"MY-H334-A17","no":17,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 17"},"chapter":{"en":"CHAPTER VI"},"text":{"en":"17. Section 2 of the principal Act is amended by Amendment\ninserting, immediately after the definition of \"goods\" ofsection 2.\nthe following new definition:\n\n\" \"Labuan\" means the Island of Labuan and its\ndependent islands, namely, Rusukan Besar,\n\nRusukan Kecil, Keraman, Burong, Papan and\nDaat;'.\n\nDICETAK OLEH GHAZALI BIN JANI, K.M.N., A-MLP., P.P.T.,\nPEMANGKU KETUA PENGARAH PERCETAKAN NEGARA, MALAYSIA\nDENGAN PERINTAH PADA Zim FEBRUARI 1990\n\nHarga: $1.20"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3340"] = {"id":"MY-H3340","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年雇员社会保障（供应）条例","en":"EMPLOYEES’ SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2021","orig":"EMPLOYEES’ SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2021","ms":"Peraturan Keselamatan Sosial Pekerja (Bekalan) 2021","vi":"Quy định về An sinh xã hội cho người lao động (Cung ứng) năm 2021","th":"ข้อบังคับประกันสังคมลูกจ้าง (การจัดหา) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Peraturan Jaminan Sosial Karyawan (Pasokan) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2021_P.U.(A)259-2021_EMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3340-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-Peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nKeselamatan Sosial Pekerja (Perbekalan) 2021.\n\nPengeluaran bagi perbelanjaan bagi tahun 2021"}},{"id":"MY-H3340-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pengeluaran sejumlah wang yang tidak melebihi satu bilion\n\nsatu ratus lima juta lima ratus lima puluh dua ribu ringgit (RM1,105,552,000) daripada\n\nKumpulan Wang Keselamatan Sosial bagi perbelanjaan untuk pentadbiran Rancangan\n\nKeselamatan Sosial bagi tahun 2021 adalah dengan ini dibenarkan bagi maksud yang\n\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nJADUAL\n\nMaksud Amaun\n\n(RM)\n\nEmolumen 253,974,000\n\nBekalan dan perkhidmatan 288,090,000\n\nPemberian, bayaran tetap dan bayaran lain 83,218,000\n\nPerbelanjaan lain 136,311,000\n\nHarta tanah, loji dan peralatan 343,959,000\n\nJUMLAH 1,105,552,000\n\nDibuat 3 Jun 2021\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)/600-1/2/11/5; PN(PU2)58/XXIII]\n\nDATUK SERI SARAVANAN A/L MURUGAN\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nEMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY ACT 1969\n\nEMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 72 of the\n\nEmployees'Social Security Act 1969 [Act 4], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation\n\n1. These regulations may be cited as the Employees' Social Security (Supply)\n\nRegulations 2021.\n\nIssue for expenditure for the year 2021\n\n2. The issue of a sum not exceeding one billion one hundred and five million five\n\nhundred and fifty-two thousand ringgit (RM1,105,552,000) from the\n\nSocial Security Fund for the expenditure on administration of the Scheme of\n\nSocial Security for the year 2021 is hereby authorized for the purposes specified\n\nin the Schedule.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nPurposes Amount\n\n(RM)\n\nEmoluments 253,974,000\n\nSupplies and services 288,090,000\n\nGrants, fixed payments and other payments 83,218,000\n\nOther expenditures 136,311,000\n\nLanded properties, plants and equipment 343,959,000\n\nTOTAL 1,105,552,000\n\nMade 3 June 2021\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)/600-1/2/11/5; PN(PU2)58/XXIII]\n\nDATUK SERI SARAVANAN A/L MURUGAN\n\nMinister of Human Resources"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3341"] = {"id":"MY-H3341","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年雇员社会保障（供应）条例","en":"EMPLOYEES’ SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2023","orig":"EMPLOYEES’ SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2023","ms":"Peraturan Keselamatan Sosial Pekerja (Bekalan) 2023","vi":"Quy định về An sinh xã hội cho người lao động (Cung ứng) năm 2023","th":"ข้อบังคับประกันสังคมลูกจ้าง (การจัดหา) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Peraturan Jaminan Sosial Karyawan (Pasokan) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2023_P.U.(A)259-2023_EMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3341-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nKeselamatan Sosial Pekerja (Perbekalan) 2023.\n\nPengeluaran bagi perbelanjaan bagi tahun 2023"}},{"id":"MY-H3341-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pengeluaran sejumlah wang yang tidak melebihi satu bilion dua ratus\n\nlapan puluh juta sembilan puluh satu ribu ringgit (RM1,280,091,000)\n\ndaripada Kumpulan Wang Keselamatan Sosial bagi perbelanjaan untuk pentadbiran\n\nRancangan Keselamatan Sosial bagi tahun 2023 adalah dengan ini dibenarkan\n\nbagi maksud yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nJADUAL\n\nMaksud Amaun\n\n(RM)\n\nEmolumen 333,326,000\n\nBekalan dan perkhidmatan 281,380,000\n\nPemberian, bayaran tetap dan bayaran lain 84,236,000\n\nPerbelanjaan lain 140,295,000\n\nHarta tanah, loji dan peralatan 440,854,000\n\nJUMLAH 1,280,091,000\n\nDibuat 30 Julai 2023\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/11/5Jld.2(31); PN(PU2)58/JLD.24]\n\n SIVAKUMAR A/L VARATHARAJU NAIDU\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nEMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY ACT 1969\n\nEMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2023\n\nIN excercise of the powers conferred by section 72\n\nof the Employees' Social Security Act 1969 [Act 4], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation\n\n1. These regulations may be cited as the Employees' Social Security (Supply)\n\nRegulations 2023.\n\nIssue for expenditure for the year 2023\n\n2. The issue of a sum not exceeding one billion two hundred and eighty million\n\nninety-one thousand ringgit (RM1,280,091,000) from the Social Security Fund for\n\nthe expenditure on administration of the Scheme of Social Security for the year 2023\n\nis hereby authorized for the purposes specified in the Schedule.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nPurpose Amount\n\n(RM)\n\nEmoluments 333,326,000\n\nSupplies and services 281,380,000\n\nGrants, fixed payments and other payments 84,236,000\n\nOther expenditures 140,295,000\n\nLanded properties, plants and equipment 440,854,000\n\nTOTAL 1,280,091,000\n\nMade 30 July 2023\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/11/5Jld.2(31); PN(PU2)58/JLD.24]\n\n SIVAKUMAR A/L VARATHARAJU NAIDU\n\n Minister of Human Resources"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3342"] = {"id":"MY-H3342","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2024&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年为公共健康管制吸烟产品（违法行为罚款了结）条例","en":"CONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2024","orig":"CONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2024","ms":"Peraturan Kawalan Produk Merokok untuk Kesihatan Awam (Pengkompaunan Kesalahan) 2024","vi":"Quy định về Kiểm soát sản phẩm hút thuốc vì sức khỏe cộng đồng (Xử lý vi phạm bằng phạt tiền) năm 2024","th":"ข้อบังคับการควบคุมผลิตภัณฑ์สูบบุหรี่เพื่อสาธารณสุข (การระงับข้อหาด้วยค่าปรับ) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Peraturan Pengendalian Produk Merokok untuk Kesehatan Publik (Penyelesaian Pelanggaran dengan Denda) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2024_P.U.(A)259-2024_CONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3342-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nKawalan Produk Merokok Demi Kesihatan Awam (Pengkompaunan Kesalahan)2024.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Oktober 2024.\n\nKesalahan yang boleh dikompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H3342-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Kesalahan yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual Pertama ditetapkan sebagai\n\nkesalahan yang boleh dikompaun.\n\n(2) Kesalahan yang boleh dikompaun itu boleh dikompaun dengan keizinan\n\nbertulis Pendakwa Raya dalam Borang 1 Jadual Kedua.\n\nTatacara mengkompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H3342-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Apabila menerima apa-apa maklumat atau aduan bahawa\n\nsuatu kesalahan yang boleh dikompaun telah dilakukan, Ketua Pengarah atau\n\nmana-mana pegawai diberi kuasa oleh Ketua Pengarah boleh, dengan keizinan bertulis\n\nPendakwa Raya yang disebut dalam subperaturan 2(2), mengeluarkan suatu\n\ntawaran untuk mengkompaun kesalahan itu dalam Borang 2 Jadual Kedua.\n\n(2) Suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu kesalahan adalah sah\n\nbagi tempoh tiga puluh hari bermula dari tarikh tawaran itu diterima oleh\n\norang yang kepadanya tawaran itu dibuat atau apa-apa tempoh lanjutan\n\nyang boleh diberikan oleh Ketua Pengarah, dan jika pembayaran penuh bagi jumlah\n\nyang ditawarkan itu dibuat pada atau sebelum habis tempoh tiga puluh hari atau apa-apa\n\ntempoh lanjutan yang diberikan itu, tiada prosiding selanjutnya boleh diambil terhadap\n\norang yang telah melakukan kesalahan itu.\n\nPenyetujuterimaan kompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H3342-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Seseorang yang menyetuju terima suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu\n\nkesalahan yang boleh dikompaun hendaklah menyetuju terima tawaran itu\n\ndalam Borang 3 Jadual Kedua dan mengembalikan Borang 3 itu kepada Ketua Pengarah\n\natau mana-mana pegawai diberi kuasa oleh Ketua Pengarah.\n\nPembayaran kompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H3342-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Jika suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu kesalahan disetuju terima\n\noleh orang yang kepadanya tawaran itu dibuat, dia hendaklah membayar kompaun itu\n\nmelalui wang tunai, kad kredit, kad debit, kad caj, atau pemindahan wang secara\n\nelektronik di mana-mana pejabat kesihatan berhampiran.\n\n(2) Suatu resit rasmi hendaklah dikeluarkan bagi tiap-tiap pembayaran yang\n\nditerima di bawah subperaturan (1) kepada orang yang kepadanya tawaran untuk\n\nmengkompaun kesalahan itu telah dibuat.\n\nPendakwaan boleh dimulakan jika tiada pembayaran dibuat"}},{"id":"MY-H3342-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Jika tiada pembayaran bagi kompaun yang ditawarkan itu dibuat dalam\n\ntempoh yang dinyatakan dalam subperaturan 3(2), pendakwaan boleh dimulakan tanpa\n\nnotis selanjutnya.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n[Subperaturan 2(1)]\n\nKESALAHAN YANG BOLEH DIKOMPAUN\n\nKesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah peruntukan Akta Kawalan Produk Merokok\n\nDemi Kesihatan Awam 2024 yang berikut ditetapkan sebagai kesalahan yang\n\nboleh dikompaun:\n\n(a) subseksyen 13(3);\n\n(b) subseksyen 16(2);\n\n(c) subseksyen 17(1); dan\n\n(d) subseksyen 18(1).\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nBORANG 1\n\n[Subperaturan 2(2)]\n\nAKTA KAWALAN PRODUK MEROKOK DEMI KESIHATAN AWAM 2024\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN KAWALAN PRODUK MEROKOK DEMI KESIHATAN AWAM\n\n(PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2024\n\nKEIZINAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nPADA menjalankan kuasa yang diberikan oleh seksyen 48 Akta Kawalan Produk Merokok\n\nDemi Kesihatan Awam 2024 [Akta 852] dan subseksyen 376(3) Kanun Tatacara Jenayah\n\n[Akta 593], saya ......................................................................................... (nama) dengan ini\n\nmemberikan keizinan untuk mengkompaun ...........................................................................................\n\n(nama orang yang kepadanya tawaran kompaun itu dibuat) bagi kesalahan\n\nyang dilakukan di bawah ....................................................................... yang dikatakan telah\n\ndilakukan pada .................................................... (tarikh) di ....................................................... (tempat).\n\nTarikh:\n\n.........................................................\n\nPendakwa Raya/\n\nTimbalan Pendakwa Raya\n\nBORANG 2\n\n[Subperaturan 3(1)]\n\nAKTA KAWALAN PRODUK MEROKOK DEMI KESIHATAN AWAM 2024\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN KAWALAN PRODUK MEROKOK DEMI KESIHATAN AWAM\n\n(PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2024\n\nTAWARAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nSemasa menjawab sila catatkan—\n\nPejabat : ……………………………………… Tempat : …………………………………\n\nNo. Rujukan : ………………………………........... Tarikh : ………………………………....\n\nKepada:\n\n………………………………………………………………\n\n………………………………………………………………\n\n………………………………………………………………\n\n*Tuan/Puan,\n\nSuatu aduan telah dibuat bahawa anda telah melakukan kesalahan yang berikut\n\ndi bawah seksyen ............................ Akta Kawalan Produk Merokok Demi Kesihatan\n\nAwam 2024 [Akta 852] dengan butir-butir seperti yang berikut:\n\nTarikh : ……………………………………………… Waktu : ……………………………………………\n\nTempat : ……………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n*Kesalahan :\n\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n…………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………...\n\n2. Menurut subseksyen 48(2) Akta Kawalan Produk Merokok Demi\n\nKesihatan Awam 2024 [Akta 852], dengan keizinan bertulis Pendakwa Raya, anda\n\nditawarkan suatu kompaun bagi kesalahan yang dinyatakan di atas bagi jumlah wang\n\nsebanyak RM ......................... (........................................................................................(dalam perkataan)\n\nringgit sahaja).\n\n3. Jika tawaran untuk mengkompaun ini disetuju terima, bayaran hendaklah dibuat\n\nmelalui *wang tunai/kad kredit/kad debit/kad caj/pemindahan wang secara elektronik\n\ndi mana-mana pejabat kesihatan berhampiran dan suatu resit rasmi akan dikeluarkan\n\napabila pembayaran kompaun itu diterima.\n\n4. Tawaran untuk mengkompaun ini sah sehingga ………………………………….. .\n\n5. Jika tiada bayaran diterima dalam tempoh yang disebut dalam perenggan 4,\n\npendakwaan bagi kesalahan itu boleh dimulakan terhadap\n\nanda/....................................................................... (nyatakan *nama individu/syarikat/perniagaan/\n\nbadan lain, jika ada ) tanpa notis selanjutnya.\n\n…………………………………………………….\n\n*Ketua Pengarah/\n\nPegawai diberi kuasa oleh Ketua Pengarah\n\n_____________________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n*Potong mana-mana yang tidak berkenaan\n\nBORANG 3\n\n[Peraturan 4]\n\nAKTA KAWALAN PRODUK MEROKOK DEMI KESIHATAN AWAM 2024\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN KAWALAN PRODUK MEROKOK DEMI KESIHATAN AWAM\n\n(PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2024\n\nPENYETUJUTERIMAAN TAWARAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nKepada:\n\n......................................................................................\n\n......................................................................................\n\n......................................................................................\n\n*Tuan/Puan,\n\nSaya merujuk kepada Tawaran untuk Mengkompaun Kesalahan dengan nombor\n\nrujukan ………………................................ bertarikh ……..........…………… .\n\n2. Saya mengaku bahawa saya telah melakukan kesalahan ini dan saya menerima\n\ntawaran untuk mengkompaun itu dan disertakan bersama-sama ini bukti pembayaran\n\nmelalui *wang tunai/kad kredit/kad debit/kad caj/pemindahan wang secara elektronik\n\nsebanyak RM ……............................. (......................................................................... (dalam perkataan)\n\nringgit sahaja) sebagai penyelesaian penuh bagi jumlah wang yang dinyatakan\n\ndalam perenggan 2 Tawaran untuk Mengkompaun Kesalahan.\n\nTandatangan : ...................................................................................\n\n**Nama (dalam huruf besar) : ..................................................................................\n\n*No. Kad Pengenalan/No. Pasport : ..................................................................................\n\n***Untuk dan bagi pihak (jika berkenaan) : ..................................................................................\n\n (nama *syarikat/perniagaaan atau badan lain)\n\n***No. Pendaftaran Syarikat/No. Lesen/\n\nNo. Permit (jika berkenaan) : ..................................................................................\n\nAlamat :\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\nTarikh : …………………………….................\n\n_____________________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n*Potong mana-mana yang tidak berkenaan\n\n**Nama orang yang kepadanya tawaran untuk mengkompaun itu dibuat atau nama pengarah bagi pihak\n\nsyarikat/perniagaan/badan lain\n\n***Dalam hal jika tawaran untuk mengkompaun itu dibuat kepada syarikat/perniagaan/badan lain\n\nDibuat 26 September 2024\n\n[KKM.600-1/1/63 JLD3 (61); PN(PU2)770]\n\n DATUK SERI DR. HAJI DZULKEFLY BIN AHMAD\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nDiluluskan 27 September 2024\n\n[KKM.600-1/1/63 JLD3 (61); PN(PU2)770]\n\n TAN SRI AHMAD TERRIRUDIN BIN MOHD SALLEH\n\n Pendakwa Raya Malaysia\n\nCONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH ACT 2024\n\nCONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH\n\n(COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 48 of the Control of Smoking Products For\n\nPublic Health Act 2024 [Act 852], the Minister, with the approval of the Public Prosecutor,\n\nmakes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Control of Smoking Products\n\nFor Public Health (Compounding of Offences) Regulations 2024.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 October 2024.\n\nCompoundable offences\n\n2. (1) The offences specified in the First Schedule are prescribed\n\nto be compoundable offences.\n\n(2) The compoundable offences may be compounded with the consent\n\nin writing of the Public Prosecutor in Form 1 of the Second Schedule.\n\nProcedure for compounding\n\n3. (1) Upon receipt of any information or complaint that a compoundable offence\n\nhas been committed, the Director General or any authorized officer authorized by the\n\nDirector General may, with the consent in writing of the Public Prosecutor\n\nreferred to in subregulation 2(2), issue an offer to compound the offence in Form 2\n\nof the Second Schedule.\n\n(2) An offer to compound an offence shall be valid for a period of thirty days\n\nstarting from the date the offer is received by the person to whom the offer is made\n\nor such extended period as the Director General may grant, and if full payment\n\nof the sum offered is made on or before the expiry of the period of thirty days or such\n\nextended period granted, no further proceedings shall be taken against the person who\n\ncommitted such offence.\n\nAcceptance of compound\n\n4. A person who accepts an offer to compound a compoundable offence shall accept\n\nthe offer in Form 3 of the Second Schedule and return Form 3 to the Director General or\n\nany authorized officer authorized by the Director General.\n\nPayment of compound\n\n5. (1) If an offer to compound an offence is accepted by the person to\n\nwhom the offer is made, he shall pay the compound by cash, credit card, debit card,\n\ncharge card or electronic money transfer at the nearest health office.\n\n(2) An official receipt shall be issued for every payment received under\n\nsubregulation (1) to the person to whom the offer to compound an offence is made.\n\nProsecution may be instituted if no payment made\n\n6. If no payment of the compound offered is made within the period specified in\n\nsubregulation 3(2), prosecution may be instituted without further notice.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n[Subregulation 2(1)]\n\nCOMPOUNDABLE OFFENCES\n\nThe offences committed under the following provisions of the Control of Smoking\n\nProducts For Public Health Act 2024 are prescribed as compoundable offences:\n\n(a) subsection 13(3);\n\n(b) subsection 16(2);\n\n(c) subsection 17(1); and\n\n(d) subsection 18(1).\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nFORM 1\n\n[Subregulation 2(2)]\n\nCONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH ACT 2024\n\nCONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH\n\n(COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2024\n\nCONSENT TO COMPOUND OFFENCE\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 48 of the Control of Smoking\n\nProducts For Public Health 2024 [Act 852] and subsection 376(3) of the Criminal\n\nProcedure Code [Act 593], I ………………………………………………..………………..… (name) hereby\n\ngive consent to compound ………………………………………………………………………… (name of\n\nthe person to whom the compound offer is made) for the offence committed\n\nunder………………………………………………… which is said to have been committed\n\non…………………………. (date) at ………………………………………………………………….. (place).\n\nDate:\n\n…………….…………………………………………\n\n Public Prosecutor/\n\nDeputy Public Prosecutor\n\nFORM 2\n\n[Subregulation 3(1)]\n\nCONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH ACT 2024\n\nCONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH\n\n(COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2024\n\nOFFER TO COMPOUND OFFENCE\n\nIn reply please quote—\n\nOffice : …………………………………………. Place : ……………………………………………\n\nReference No.: …………………………………………. Date : ……………………………………………\n\nTo:\n\n………………………………………………………………\n\n………………………………………………………………\n\n………………………………………………………………\n\n*Sir/Madam,\n\nA complaint has been made that you have committed the following\n\noffence under section …………………… of the Control of Smoking Products For\n\nPublic Health 2024 [Act 852] with the following particulars:\n\nDate : ………………………………………………… Time : ……………………………………………………….\n\nPlace : ……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………….\n\n*Offence :\n\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n2. Pursuant to subsection 48(2) of the Control of Smoking Products For Public Health\n\nAct 2024 [Act 852], with the consent in writing of the Public Prosecutor, you are offered\n\na compound for the offence stated above for the sum of RM………………\n\n(…………………………………………………………………………………(in words) ringgit only).\n\n3. If this offer to compound is accepted, payment shall be made by *cash/credit card/\n\ndebit card/charge card/electronic money transfer at the nearest health office\n\nand an official receipt will be issued on receipt of the payment of the compound.\n\n4. This offer to compound shall be valid until …………………………………... .\n\n5. If no payment is received within the period referred to in paragraph 4,\n\nthe prosecution for the offence may be instituted against\n\nyou/………………………………………………… (state *name of individual/company/business/other body,\n\nif any) without further notice.\n\n……………………………………………………\n\n*Director General/\n\nAuthorized Officer authorized by\n\nthe Director General\n\n_____________________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n*Delete whichever is inapplicable\n\nFORM 3\n\n[Regulation 4]\n\nCONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH ACT 2024\n\nCONTROL OF SMOKING PRODUCTS FOR PUBLIC HEALTH\n\n(COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2024\n\nACCEPTANCE OF OFFER TO COMPOUND OFFENCE\n\nTo:\n\n......................................................................................\n\n......................................................................................\n\n......................................................................................\n\n*Sir/Madam,\n\nI refer to the Offer to Compound Offence bearing the reference number\n\n…............................................................... dated ……..........…………… .\n\n2. I admit that I have committed this offence and I accept the offer to compound\n\nand enclosed herewith is the proof of payment by *cash/credit card/debit card/\n\ncharge card/electronic fund transfer for the sum of RM….............................\n\n(………………………………………………...........................………………….…. (in words) ringgit only)\n\nas full settlement of the sum stipulated in paragraph 2 of the Offer to Compound Offence.\n\nSignature : ...................................................................................\n\n**Name (in capital letter) : ...................................................................................\n\n*Identification No./Passport No. : ...................................................................................\n\n***For and on behalf (if applicable) : ...................................................................................\n\n (name of *company/business or other body)\n\n***Company Registration No./Licence No./\n\nPermit No. (if applicable) : ..................................................................................\n\nAddress :\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\nDate : ............................................\n\n_____________________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n*Delete whichever is inapplicable\n\n**Name of the person to whom the offer to compound is made or name of the director on behalf of\n\ncompany/business/other body\n\n***In the case where the offer to compound is made to company/business/other body\n\nMade 26 September 2024\n\n[KKM.600-1/1/63 JLD3 (61); PN(PU2)770]\n\n DATUK SERI DR. HAJI DZULKEFLY BIN AHMAD\n\nMinister of Health\n\nApproved 27 September 2024\n\n[KKM.600-1/1/63 JLD3 (61); PN(PU2)770]\n\n TAN SRI AHMAD TERRIRUDIN BIN MOHD SALLEH\n\n Public Prosecutor of Malaysia"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3343"] = {"id":"MY-H3343","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2025&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年正规军（退休金、恩恤金及其他福利）（修正）（第2号）条例","en":"REGULAR FORCES (PENSIONS, GRATUITIES AND OTHER BENEFITS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2025","orig":"REGULAR FORCES (PENSIONS, GRATUITIES AND OTHER BENEFITS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2025","ms":"Peraturan Angkatan Tetap (Pencen, Ganjaran dan Faedah Lain) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2025","vi":"Quy định về Lực lượng thường trực (Lương hưu, tiền thưởng và các phúc lợi khác) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2025","th":"ข้อบังคับกำลังรบประจำการ (บำนาญ เงินบำเหน็จ และผลประโยชน์อื่น) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Peraturan Pasukan Reguler (Pensiun, Uang Jasa, dan Tunjangan Lain) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2025_P.U.(A)259-2025_REGULAR FORCES (PENSIONS, GRATUITIES AND OTHER BENEFITS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2025.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3343-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nAngkatan Tetap (Pencen, Ganjaran dan Faedah-Faedah Lain) (Pindaan)\n\n(No. 2) 2025.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa\n\npada 1 Januari 2009.\n\nPindaan peraturan 19"}},{"id":"MY-H3343-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Angkatan Tetap (Pencen, Ganjaran dan\n\nFaedah-Faedah Lain) 1982 [P.U. (A) 123/1982] dipinda dalam peraturan 19—\n\n(a) dalam subperaturan (1), (1A) dan (1B), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"satu ratus dua puluh hari\" dengan perkataan \"satu ratus lima puluh hari\";\n\ndan\n\n(b) dalam subperaturan (1D), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"sebelum 1 Ogos 2003 hendaklah tertakluk kepada maksimum\n\nsembilan puluh hari\" dengan perkataan \"antara 1 Ogos 2003\n\nhingga 31 Disember 2008 hendaklah tertakluk kepada maksimum\n\nsatu ratus dua puluh hari\".\n\nDibuat 29 Julai 2025\n\n[MOD.600-1/2/10; PN(PU2)140/JLD.16]\n\n DATUK LOKMAN HAKIM BIN ALI\n\n Setiausaha Majlis Angkatan Tentera\n\nARMED FORCES ACT 1972\n\nREGULAR FORCES (PENSIONS, GRATUITIES AND OTHER BENEFITS) (AMENDMENT)\n\n(NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 187 of the\n\nArmed Forces Act 1972 [Act 77], the Armed Forces Council, with the approval of the\n\nYang di-Pertuan Agong, makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
  FT["MY-H3344"] = {"id":"MY-H3344","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 259/2026&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年反洗钱、反恐融资与非法活动收益（现金与不记名可转让票据申报）（修正）令","en":"ANTI-MONEY LAUNDERING, ANTI-TERRORISM FINANCING AND PROCEEDS OF UNLAWFUL ACTIVITIES (CASH AND BEARER NEGOTIABLE INSTRUMENTS DECLARATION) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2026","orig":"ANTI-MONEY LAUNDERING, ANTI-TERRORISM FINANCING AND PROCEEDS OF UNLAWFUL ACTIVITIES (CASH AND BEARER NEGOTIABLE INSTRUMENTS DECLARATION) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Pencegahan Pengubahan Wang Haram, Pembiayaan Keganasan dan Hasil Aktiviti Haram (Pengisytiharan Wang Tunai dan Instrumen Boleh Pindah Pembawa) (Pindaan) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Chống rửa tiền, chống tài trợ khủng bố và lợi nhuận từ hoạt động bất hợp pháp (Khai báo tiền mặt và công cụ chuyển nhượng vô danh) (Sửa đổi) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งการป้องกันการฟอกเงิน การต่อต้านการสนับสนุนทางการเงินแก่การก่อการร้าย และผลประโยชน์จากกิจกรรมผิดกฎหมาย (การสำแดงเงินสดและตราสารเปลี่ยนมือผู้ถือ) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Anti Pencucian Uang, Pendanaan Terorisme, dan Hasil Kejahatan (Deklarasi Uang Tunai dan Instrumen Berharga Atas Unjuk) (Perubahan) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA259","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2026_P.U.(A)259-2026_ANTI-MONEY LAUNDERING, ANTI-TERRORISM FINANCING AND PROCEEDS OF UNLAWFUL ACTIVITIES (CASH AND B.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3344-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pencegahan Pengubahan  Wang\nHaram, Pencegahan Pembiayaan Keganasan dan Hasil daripada Aktiviti Haram\n(Perisytiharan Wang Tunai dan Instrumen Boleh Niaga Pembawa) (Pindaan) 2026.\n\nPindaan perenggan 1"}},{"id":"MY-H3344-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Pencegahan Pengubahan Wang Haram, Pencegahan Pembiayaan\nKeganasan dan Hasil daripada Aktiviti Haram (Perisytiharan Wang Tunai dan Instrumen\nBoleh Niaga Pembawa) 2014 [ P.U. (A) 265/2014 ], yang disebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam\nPerintah ini, dipinda dalam subperenggan 1(1) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan\n\"Pencegahan Pembiayaan Keganasan\" perkataan \",  Pencegahan Pembiayaan Aktiviti\nTerhad\".\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H3344-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perenggan 2  Perintah ibu dipinda  dengan menggantikan perkataan \"dalam\nBorang Kastam No. 22 sebagaimana yang ditetapkan dalam Bahagian I Jadual Kedua\nPeraturan-Peraturan Kastam 1977 [P.U. (A) 162/1977]\" dengan perkataan \"sebagaimana\nyang ditetapkan dalam Peraturan-Peraturan Kastam 2019 [P.U. (A) 397/2019]\".\n\nPindaan perenggan 3"}},{"id":"MY-H3344-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Perenggan 3 Perintah ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam subperenggan (1), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\"dalam Borang Kastam No. 1 sebagaimana yang ditetapkan dalam\nBahagian I Jadual Kedua Peraturan -Peraturan Kastam 1977\" dengan\nperkataan \"sebagaimana yang ditetapkan dalam Peraturan -Peraturan\nKastam 2019\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam subperenggan (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\"dalam Borang Kastam No. 2 sebagaimana yang ditetapkan dalam\nBahagian I Jadual Kedua Peraturan -Peraturan Kastam 1977\" dengan\nperkataan \"sebagaimana yang di tetapkan dalam Peraturan -Peraturan\nKastam 2019\".\n\nDibuat 3 Julai 2026\n[BNM.JUN.100-1/12/5 (CBNI (A) Order) 2025; PN(PU2)622/JLD.60]\n\nDATO' SERI SHAIK ABDUL RASHEED BIN ABDUL GHAFFOUR\nPihak Berkuasa Berwibawa\nANTI-MONEY LAUNDERING, ANTI-TERRORISM FINANCING, ANTI-RESTRICTED\nACTIVITY FINANCING AND PROCEEDS OF UNLAWFUL ACTIVITIES ACT 2001\n\nANTI-MONEY LAUNDERING, ANTI-TERRORISM FINANCING AND PROCEEDS OF\nUNLAWFUL ACTIVITIES (CASH AND BEARER NEGOTIABLE INSTRUMENTS\nDECLARATION) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsections 28 B(1), 28C(1) and 28 E(1)\nof the Anti -Money Laundering, Anti -Terrorism Financing, Anti -Restricted Activity\nFinancing and Proceeds of Unlawful Activities Act 2001 [ Act 613 ], the competent\nauthority makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-7"};
